### Tüm yazılar
GET http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts

### Yeni yazı oluştur
POST http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "My First Blog Post",
    "content": "This is the content of my first blog post.",
    "category": "Technology",
    "tags": ["Tech", "Programming"]
}

### Tek yazı
GET http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts/1

### Arama
GET http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts?term=tech

### Güncelle
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "My Updated Blog Post",
    "content": "This is the updated content.",
    "category": "Technology",
    "tags": ["Tech"]
}

### Hatalı istek (başlık yok, tags liste değil)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "No title here",
    "category": "Test",
    "tags": "not-a-list"
}

### Sil
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts/1

### Olmayan yazı
GET http://127.0.0.1:5002/posts/999